The cycling-weather-site repo cannot include changes to the daily refresh
scripts because they live in a separate workspace tree
(`/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/`). Apply this diff there once this
PR is merged, then a single cron run will regenerate `data.json` with the
new schema (see milestone M2 in the workflow plan).

Affected file:
  /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/cycling_weather_data_build.py

Change summary:
  - Add SCHEMA_VERSION = 1 (top-level `version` key in data.json)
  - Add hero block (top destination, lead window, go_count, editorial copy)
  - Add changelog block (rank deltas + qualifier flips vs previous snapshot)
  - Add narratives block (empty placeholder for matured-forecast retrospectives)
  - Add `slug` to every results entry (kebab-cased name) for routing
